Loosen version constraints and check in Cargo.lock

Set all dependency version constraints to `>= 0` so `cargo update`
always picks the latest compatible release, pin the rustc toolchain
to 1.95.0, and start tracking `Cargo.lock` for reproducible builds.

Fix a rand 0.10 compatibility issue: `random_range` moved to a new
`RngExt` trait, which now needs to be imported.
